Hopf problem blueprint — Uniformizing the (3,4,∞) orbifold chapter.

The base of Alpöge's fibred threefold: the (3,4,∞) triangle group acting on the upper
half-plane, its orbit space compactified to a Riemann surface biholomorphic to P¹, and
the three period functions τ, μ, β assembled into the period map of Theorem 3.4.
-/

